(globalThis.CATALOGUE_RECORD_CHUNKS??=Object.create(null))[512]={"source_order":512,"notes":["The faint grey shapes across the page are judged to be show-through, not faint pencil writing on 256b. Native tiles show reversed letterforms that are consistent with the recto layout.","The reading of the superscript after '256' as 'b' is based on the folio label and the visible letterform.","The right portion of the image shows the edge of the facing page, fol. 257. Its marginal notes are not target-page text: the circled 'main', 'c.104(3)', 'ff.2-15', the bracketed 'Begins ... Indriya...' note, and 'ff.1-71, ... R.L.M.' near the bottom.","Faint mirrored show-through of the catalogue entries on the recto (fol. 256) is visible across the ruled lines. It is not ink on this page and has not been inventoried as blocks.","I reviewed the overview and all six native tiles: top, middle, bottom, outer margin, gutter and the spaces between ruled lines. Apart from the folio number, the page has no catalogue entries, headings, cross-references or marginal notes in ink or pencil.","The faint grey letterforms across the ruled lines are mirror-image show-through of the entries on the recto, fol. 256. They are not writing on this page and are not transcribed.","Several non-text marks are present. Dark triangular tab or mounting shadows sit at the top edge, near x 300–330 and x 770–860. A short faint diagonal stroke with a dot lies near x 1705–1795, y 675–715. Short faint pencil dashes appear in the left margin at about y 1460–1580, x 340–470; the inventory gave these at y 3060–3240, so the position should be checked. A grey abrasion smudge lies at about x 470–650, y 2620–2960. Binding thread and gutter shadow run along the inner edge. None of these marks is legible as text.","The right edge of the image shows part of the facing page, fol. 257. Its marginal notes are not target text and have not been recorded here: the circled 'main', 'c.104(3)', 'ff.2-15', the 'Begins ... Indriya...' note, and 'ff.1-71, ... R.L.M.'"],"records":[{"id":"css-prod-0512-r001","local_id":"r001","source_order":512,"folio":"256b","folio_label":"fol. 256b","sequence":1,"page_id":"0f11d2dc-8a98-4e5f-be60-1eeccd5ee621","kind":"other","record_type":"non_catalogue_text","source_model_record_type":"non_catalogue_text","subtype":"folio_number","shelfmark":"","titleLiteral":"","titleNormalized":"","displayTitle":"Catalogue text","authorOrSource":"","source":"","subject":"","subjectGroup":"","date":"","extent":"","lines":"","script":"","incipit":"","transcription":"256b","annotations":["Pencil folio number in the top left corner of the page.","The final 'b' is written raised, as a superscript, after '256'."],"uncertainties":["The superscript letter is read as 'b'. This agrees with the supplied folio label and with the visible letterform."],"focused_readings":[],"reviewNotes":[],"editorialNotes":[],"relationships":[],"editorial_context":[],"block_ids":["b001"],"locations":[{"block_id":"b001","bbox":[340,295,150,140]}],"isCancelled":false,"needsReview":true,"human_verified":false,"verification_status":"machine_reviewed","change_audit":[],"sourceCitationURL":"https://iiif.bodleian.ox.ac.uk/iiif/canvas/0f11d2dc-8a98-4e5f-be60-1eeccd5ee621.json","auditPath":"audit/pages/0512.json","attachedNotes":[],"resolvedRelationships":[],"attachedRecords":[]}]};
